    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yehoahazi kūbiza ntemi wa Isilaeli",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 13:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu ng'waka gwa makūmi abīlī n'idatū go būtemi bo ng'wa Yoashi ng'witūnja o ng'wa Ahazia ntemi wa Yuda, Yehoahazi ng'witūnja o ng'wa Yehu ūbiza ntemi wa Isilaeli mu Samalia, ūsuga ikanza lya myaka ikūmi na mpungatī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.13.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.13.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 13:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nang'hwe akīīta yabūbi ū mu miso ga ng'wa SEEBA, nguno akalondeela būbi bo ng'wa Yeloboamu ng'witūnja o ng'wa Nebati; būbi ūbo walī wabenhelaja Baisilaeli kūshimīzīla mubo; nū Yehoahazi atagalūkile kūlekana nabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.13.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.13.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 13:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū ū būpelanu bo ng'wa SEEBA būbapembekela ikanza ilīhu a Baisilaeli; ūbatūūla ha sīlīlī ya būsugi bo ng'wa Hazaeli ntemi wa Alamu, nū ng'witūnja wakwe ū Beni-hadadi, nang'hwe ūbasuga ū mu shikū jakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.13.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.13.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 13:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ū Yehoahazi aho wanomba ū SEEBA kūnchīla shigongo, ū SEEBA nang'hwe ūng'wigwa, nguno akabona ūmo ntemi wa Alamu wabaluhījaga a Baisilaeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.13.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.13.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 13:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū ū SEEBA ūbinha ngunanhi a Baisilaeli, bīnga ū mu būsugwa wa Baalamu. A Baisilaeli bandya kwikala mu kaya jabo hangī gīt'ūmo bikalīlaga kwandya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.13.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.13.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 13:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwike batagalūkile na kūlekana nabo ū būhūbi wabo, ūbo baalī benhelejiwa na numba ya ng'wa Yeloboamu, ūbo walī wabenheleja Baisilaeli kūwīta. Bakikala bakūwītaga dūhū; nī ng'hīngī ya ng'wa Ashela yalī ītaalī yīmīīlile ū mu Samalia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.13.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.13.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 13:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū mu shikū jenījo ī libità lya bashilikale ba ng'wa Yehoahazi līkageehiwa no; ūlekeelelwa falasa makūmi atanò na magogoteni ikūmi dūhū, a bashilikale ba kūshimīza bo magūlū a bene shihūmbī ikūmi. A bose pye būkenaagūlwa na ntemi wa Alamu, ūbīīta kūbiza gītī lūbuubu ng'wikanza lya matūla būsīga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.13.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.13.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 13:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mihayo yīngī ī ya mu shikū ja būtemi bo ng'wa Yehoahazi, īyo wīta nī ya būtindi wakwe, ī yose yandīkilwe mu shitabo sha ng'hūlū ja batemi ba Isilaeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.13.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.13.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 13:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Yehoahazi wifuula na bakūlūgenji bakwe, ūjīkwa mu nzengo gwa Samalia. Ng'witūnja wakwe Yehoashi wingīla a ha ng'wanya gwakwe, ūbiza ntemi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.13.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.13.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yehoashi kūbiza ntemi wa Isilaeli",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 13:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.13.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.13.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 13:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu ng'waka gwa makūmi adatū na mpungatī go būtemi bo ng'wa Yoashi ng'witūnja o ng'wa Ahazia ntemi wa Yuda, Yehoashi ng'witūnja o ng'wa Yehoahazi ūbiza ntemi wa Isilaeli mu Samalia, ūsuga ikanza lya myaka ikūmi n'ītandatū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.13.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.13.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 13:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nang'hwe wīta yabūbi ū mu miso ga ng'wa SEEBA, nguno atalekanile nū būhūbi bo ng'wa Yeloboamu ū ng'witūnja o ng'wa Nebati; būbi ūbo walī wabenhelaja a Baisilaeli kūwīta; nū wei ongeja ū kūwīta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.13.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.13.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 13:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mihayo yīngī ī ya mu shikū ja būtemi bo ng'wa Yehoashi, īyo wīta nī ya būtindi wakwe, pyī nī ya būlūgū wakwe ūbo akalwa na Amazia ntemi wa Yuda, ī yose yandīkilwe mu shitabo sha ng'hūlū ja batemi ba Isilaeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.13.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.13.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 13:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nang'hwe ū Yehoashi wifuula na bakūlūgenji bakwe, ng'witūnja wakwe Yeloboamu wingīla a ha ng'wanya gwakwe, ūbiza ntemi. Ū Yehoashi ūjīkwa mu nzengo gwa Samalia hamò na batemi ba Isilaeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.13.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.13.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kūcha kwa ng'wa Elisha",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 13:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.13.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.13.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 13:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū mu shikū jenījo ū Elisha ūsaata būsaatu ūbo nose būkamūlaga. Ū ntemi wa Isilaeli ū Yehoashi ūja kūngīsha; aho washika hoi ūlīla alīhaya, “Baba! Baba! Magogoteni ga Isilaeli, na badamhīji ba falasa ba Isilaeli!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.13.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.13.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 13:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Elisha ūng'wīla, “Solaga būta na masonga wenhe aha.” Wīta ng'hana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.13.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.13.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 13:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū Elisha ūng'wīla ū ntemi wa Isilaeli, “Būdimage mu nkono gwako ū būta.” Aho wīta gīko, ū Elisha ūgūtūūla ū nkono gwakwe a ha makono ga ntemi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.13.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.13.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 13:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ūng'wīla, “Līlugūlage ī lidilisha īlo līlī kīya lyenīlo.” Ūlīlugūla; hūna ū Elisha ūng'wīla, “Lasaga;” ūlasa. Hūna ū Elisha ūhaya, “Isonga lya būtindi bo ng'wa SEEBA, isonga lya būtindi bo ng'wa SEEBA kū Ba-Alamu. Nguno a Ba-Alamu ūkūjūlwīla nabo Afeki kūshisha ūbakenaagūle gete.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.13.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.13.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 13:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ūng'wīla hangī, “Gasolage a masonga.” Ū ntemi wīta ng'hana. Ū Elisha ūng'wīla, “Gakiinūjage hasī a masonga genayo.” Ūgakiinūja hasī ng'hangala idatū ooya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.13.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.13.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 13:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū munhū o ng'wa Mulungu ūmpelanīla no; ūng'wīla, “Walemūgakiinūja a hasī ng'hangala itanò nūūlū itandatū, nguno ū mu gīko ni wabaheeba kībi a Ba-Alamu, nīyo ni wabakenaagūla gete. Alīyo ī haha ūkūbapyena ng'hangala idatū dūhū.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.13.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.13.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 13:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hanuma ya henaho ū Elisha ūcha, ūjīkwa. Ū mu shikū jenījo, Bamoabu baalī bamanīīla kwīdumīla ī sī mu shikū ja matūja malaale. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.13.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.13.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 13:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lwise lūmò a Baisilaeli banjīkaga munhū, kwitulwa babona ibità lya banishi baliza kūbadumīla. Ū mimba gwa munhū ng'wenūyo būgūponya mu shigila īsho walī wajīkīlwa moi Elisha. Ū mimba gwakwe aho gwikuumya na a maguha ga ng'wa Elisha ūpīmbūka, ūjūdūka wīmīīla na magūlū gakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.13.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.13.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 13:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū ntemi wa Alamu ū Hazaeli walī wabaluhya no a Baisilaeli ū mu shikū pyī ī ja būsugi bo ng'wa Yehoahazi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.13.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.13.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 13:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo nose ū SEEBA akabachīla shigongo, ūbasaatwa kūlwa ilagane lyakwe na Abulahamu, Isaka, na Yakobo. Nguno kūshisha ikanza lyenīlo ū SEEBA walī atatogilwe ū kūbakenaagūla, nūūlū kūbabbalasanya bīnge ū kū būtongi wakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.13.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.13.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 13:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū ū ntemi wa Alamu ū Hazaeli aho waacha, ng'witūnja wakwe Beni-hadadi wingīla a ha ng'wanya gwakwe ūbiza ntemi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.13.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.13.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 13:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Yehoashi ng'witūnja o ng'wa Yehoahazi ūntaaja ū Beni-hadadi ū ng'witūnja o ng'wa Hazaeli ī mizengo īyo ise Hazaeli walī wīdima mu būlūgū kūfuma kūlī ise Yehoahazi. Ū Yehoashi ūshisha kadatū akūmpyenaga ū Beni-hadadi, wīshosha ī mizengo ya Isilaeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.13.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.13.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
